# About Rhythm Culture

Rhythm Culture brings West African drumming, dance, music and culture to schools, workplaces and communities across Australia. Our mission is simple: to share the fun, joy and movement of West African rhythm with as many people as possible.

{% button label="Get in touch" href="/contact-us-2/" align="left" /%}

Co-founded on the Sunshine Coast by Bec and Nathaniel Combs.
